repository-code: "https://github.com/Khanakag-17/CAELIX_Smart_Cart_System"
abstract: >-
  A multi-modal self-checkout smart cart that cross-verifies barcode scans,
  measured cart weight, and YOLOv8 computer-vision detections to identify
  mis-scans and shrinkage. Built on ESP32 with dual load cells, a Flask
  middleware, and Cloud Firestore.
keywords:
  - smart cart
  - retail automation
  - object detection
  - YOLOv8
  - ESP32
  - IoT
